ut his lack of willingness to further education, which may affect adaptability for long-distance routes. In contrast, Candidate B shows strong stress resilience and conscientiousness, but his uncooperative attitude is a serious drawback. Candidate D's responsibility and problem solving are strong, but his arrogance and moody nature raise crew cooperation concerns. Candidate A's leadership and technical vision are promising, but his unfriendly demeanor and unhealthy habits raise reliability concerns. Therefore, I still recommend C, but we should verify that his communication issues are manageable.\n\nThus we can keep vote Candidate C.\n\nWe need to output PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON.\n\nProceed."}
